        "html": "<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Pet Grooming Hair Removal Glove</title>\n\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@700;900&amp;family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n<style>\n  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n\n  :root {\n    --clay: #C4896A;\n    --deep: #3B2A1E;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: var(--deep);\n  }\n\n  .section-label {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--clay);\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .section-title {\n    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\n    font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 38px);\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(--deep);\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n\n  .features {\n    background: #fff;\n    padding: 72px 40px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #F0EBE6;\n  }\n\n  .features-inner,\n  .how-inner {\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .features-grid,\n  .steps {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));\n    gap: 24px;\n  }\n\n  .feat-card {\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid #EDE8E3;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    padding: 28px 24px;\n  }\n\n  .feat-icon {\n    width: 48px;\n    height: 48px;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    background: rgba(196,137,106,0.15);\n  }\n\n  .feat-card h3 {\n    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .feat-card p,\n  .step p {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    color: #9A8070;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    font-weight: 300;\n  }\n\n  .how {\n    background: #fff;\n    padding: 72px 40px;\n  }\n\n  .step {\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .step-circle {\n    width: 60px;\n    height: 60px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--deep);\n    color: #fff;\n    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin: 0 auto 20px;\n  }\n\n  .step h4 {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"features\">\n  <div class=\"features-inner\">\n    <p class=\"section-label\">Why it works</p>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Grooming made<br>effortless.</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"features-grid\">\n      <div class=\"feat-card\">\n        <div class=\"feat-icon\">🐾</div>\n        <h3>Removes Loose Fur</h3>\n        <p>Gently collects shedding hair from cats and dogs before it ends up on your furniture.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"feat-card\">\n        <div class=\"feat-icon\">✨</div>\n        <h3>Soft Massage Feel</h3>\n        <p>Flexible grooming tips help relax your pet while cleaning their coat.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"feat-card\">\n        <div class=\"feat-icon\">🧤</div>\n        <h3>Comfortable Glove Fit</h3>\n        <p>Easy to wear and control, making daily grooming faster and more natural.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"feat-card\">\n        <div class=\"feat-icon\">🧼</div>\n        <h3>Reusable &amp; Easy to Clean</h3>\n        <p>Peel off collected fur, rinse when needed, and use it again anytime.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"how\">\n  <div class=\"how-inner\">\n    <p class=\"section-label\">Dead simple</p>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">How it works</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"steps\">\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"step-circle\">1</div>\n        <h4>Wear the glove</h4>\n        <p>Slip it onto your hand and adjust for a comfortable fit.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"step-circle\">2</div>\n        <h4>Gently brush</h4>\n        <p>Stroke your pet’s coat to lift loose fur, dust, and dirt.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"step-circle\">3</div>\n        <h4>Collect the hair</h4>\n        <p>The glove gathers shedding hair as you groom.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"step-circle\">4</div>\n        <h4>Peel &amp; Clean</h4>\n        <p>Remove the collected fur and rinse the glove when needed.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
